 Project: Universal RF Transceiver Backplane Array & SPI Hardware Serialization
 Subsystem: Kit 17 - Hardware Transceiver Mapping Loop (No Compiler Binary Required)
 Hardware: 2x NRF24L01+ Transceivers, 2x YL-105 Adaptors, Jumper Array, Breadboard
 Maintainer: Zaritech Systems (A division of Zaritech Dynamics)
